# Root .vercelignore for `vercel deploy` from the monorepo root (untracked; CLI uses this INSTEAD of .gitignore).
# Keeps apps/web/public/unity-build/ (gitignored) in the upload and drops the 2.5 GB Unity project.
# Root-only entries are anchored with a leading slash — an unanchored `lib` would also drop apps/web/src/lib.
.git
node_modules
.next
*.tsbuildinfo
.env
.env.local
.DS_Store
/packages/battle-engine
/out
/cache
/lib
/docs
/test
/contracts
/scripts
/.github
/.claude
/.agents
/_hermes_backups
/.hermes_backups
/hermes_backups
